    features=["Holds its position and altitude with no input; steady at any frame rate", "Battery: when it runs out the motors stop and the drone falls", "Signal range: static near the edge, lost link beyond it", "Hitting something too fast breaks it into debris", "Target marker: where a bomb released now would land", "Photo mode hides the HUD", "Own voxel model, rotor blur, blinking LEDs, hum"],
