    features=["Up to 2 tornadoes at once", "Bending, swaying funnel of smoke, a dust ring, flying debris", "Pulls in, spins, lifts and flings; heavy things resist", "Vehicles and the player can be lifted; walls shield you", "Tears glass, wood and plaster; concrete and metal at higher strength", "Wind roar that grows as it comes, thunder, camera shake"],
